ht:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--color-gold))"></div><span style="font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--color-gold)">🪷</span><div style="width:clamp(30px, 8vw, 100px);height:1px;background:linear-gradient(270deg, transparent, var(--color-gold))"></div></div><h2 class="font-script" style="font-size:clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4.5rem);color:var(--color-gold);text-shadow:0 2px 15px rgba(205,181,114,0.3);margin:0 0 0.5rem 0">શ્રી - સ્વજન પ્રીતિ</h2><p class="font-serif" style="font-size:clamp(0.9rem, 2.5vw, 1.2rem);color:var(--color-gold-light);opacity:0.8;letter-spacing:1px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto">શાહ - પટેલ પરિવાર ના સ્નેહી સ્વજન શ્રી</p></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:3rem"><div style="position:relative;background:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-radius:24px;padding:clamp(1.2rem, 4vw, 1.8rem) clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);border:1px solid rgba(205,181,114,0.15);box-shadow:0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);text-align:center;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:10px;font-size:1.2rem;opacity:0.2;color:var(--color-gold)">⚜️</div><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;right:10px;font-size:1.2rem;opacity:0.2;color:var(--color-gold)">⚜️</div><div style="font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:1rem;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(205,181,114,0.3))">🪷</div><h3 class="font-script" style="font-size:2.5rem;color:var(--color-gold);margin-bottom:0.2rem">સ્નેહાધીન</h3><p class="font-sans" style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--color-gold-light);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;opacity:0.7">પટેલ પરિવાર</p><div style="width:50px;height:1px;background:var(--color-gold);margin:0 auto 1.5rem auto;opacity:0.3"></div><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0"><li style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.1rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);margin-bottom:0.6rem;line-height:1.4">સ્વ